| -------------- | --------------------- |
| 1 USDT         | 1 × 10^18             |
| 10 USDT        | 10 × 10^18            |
| 0.5 USDT       | 0.5 × 10^18           |
| 100.50 USDT    | 100.5 × 10^18         |
| 0.000001 USDT  | 10^-18 (minimum unit) |

